[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふんふふふ～ん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm hm hmm~♪"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レースナちゃーん！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resnaaa!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃあっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、ななな、破廉恥な……って、リアスちゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what are you— that's indecent— wait, Rias?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーい、リアス・アイトライゼだよ！\n驚いた？\u3000レスナちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The one and only Rias Eidreise! Did I surprise you, Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前な、調合中に抱きついたら危ないだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, you can't just tackle someone in the middle of synthesis. You could get hurt."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だからちゃーんと大丈夫な時に抱きついたもん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why I waited until she was clearly done!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、本当に危なそうだったら止めてたのは確かね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To be fair, I would've stopped you if it actually looked dangerous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、リアスは相変わらずだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha, same old Rias."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアさんとイザナさんも、\nやっほー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria, Izana! Hey hey hey!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えーっと、二人ともみんな知り合いみたいだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, you two know everyone here, or..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、はじめまして。スレイ・クロスリッターと\n申します。あなたは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, sorry—nice to meet you. I'm Slade Clauslyter. And you are...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、レスナの縁者、親類にあたるメーヴェと申します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm Mowen. A relative of Resna's, you could say."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、お母さん。面食いなんだから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mom, honestly... you're such a flirt..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、お母さん……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "M-mom...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "違います、お姉さんです。\nところでスレイさん、この後二人でお茶でも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No no, big sis. Now then, Slade—how about the two of us grab some tea later..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おかーさん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Moooom..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさかの、友達のお母さんがライバルに……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, is her mom about to become the competition...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リアスも真に受けるな、どう見ても冗談だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't take the bait, Rias. She's obviously joking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうそう、冗談よ冗談。私にはユリウスっていう\n最高の旦那様がいるんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course I am! I've got Julius waiting for me back home—the most wonderful husband in the world!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、ノロケのダシにされただけだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So we were just props for bragging about her husband."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "落ち着きのない母ですみません……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm so sorry about her..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どっちが母か分からないわね、これじゃ。\nで、見たところ、錬金術士仲間って感じ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The way you're acting, I can't tell which one of us is the mother. Anyway—looks like you're all alchemist friends?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺は違います。錬金術士なのはリアスのほうです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not me. Rias is the alchemist. I'm just along for the ride."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんにはあたしたちの生まれ故郷、\nハルフェンを救うのを助けてもらったんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna helped us save our hometown, Hallfein. She was amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。その後も文通してたんだけど、今は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We kept in touch after that. And now—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハルフェンも一人前になったから、\nあたしたちもレスナちゃんの助けになれたらなって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hallfein's back on its feet, so we figured it was time to return the favor!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、そうだったの。\nリアスちゃんもスレイくんも、ありがとね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, how wonderful. Thank you both, really."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人は今日、どうしてここに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what brings you here today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふっふっふ。それはね～……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fufu... well, you see~..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実は、俺たちで「九偉人図」について調べていたら、\n意外なほど近くに手掛かりを見つけたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We were doing our own research on the Portraits of the Nine, and we ended up finding a lead somewhere pretty close to home."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハルフェン近郊の、九偉人伝承が強く残る地域。\nそこを調査したところ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's a region near Hallfein with strong ties to the legends of the Nine. When we went to investigate..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聖地って言われる洞窟があったの。\n一緒に探検に行こうよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There was a cave they say is sacred! Come on, we have to go explore it together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん……！\u3000もし「九偉人図」がそこにあれば、\nいよいよ９枚揃う……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah...! If one of the portraits is in there, we'd finally have all nine...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう！\u3000リアスちゃん、スレイさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Rias! And you too, Slade!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お役に立てた感じ？\u3000いぇーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Happy to help! Woohoo!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いぇーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woohoo!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "メーヴェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mowen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……すごく、元気なお母さんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Your mom is, uh. Very energetic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "重ね重ね、母が、すみません……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am so sorry, again, for my mother..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人懐っこい性格の元気な冒険者。\nレスナから錬金術を教わったことがある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A bright, sociable adventurer who once learned alchemy from Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス・アイトライゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias Eidreise"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "落ち着いた物腰のしっかり者の青年。\nリアスの同居人で、レスナたちとは知り合い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A calm and dependable young man who lives with Rias. He and Resna's group are already acquainted."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ・クロスリッター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade Clauslyter"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]